      "description": "Glasmåleri av Jakobsstige PERIODE: ca. 1610 FUNNSTAD: Hopperstad kyrkje KOMMUNE: Vik\n\nENGLISH: Glass painting depicting Jacobs ladder from the Bible, from about year 1610. Found i Hopperstad stave church in Vik, Western Norway.",
